# Écran Budgets : simulation du prévu (POST .../reporting/forecast-simulation), enregistrement des budgets et refus d'un changement concurrent.
# Lancement : npx httpyac send --all http/budgets-simulation.http --var port=<PORT> --var anon=<ANON_KEY de `supabase status`>
# (la clé vient de la ligne de commande, jamais du fichier ; les utilisateurs sont jetables, créés par le fichier)
# Prérequis : Supabase local avec la migration 20261107100000_replace_period_budgets_expected.sql, back local démarré sur <PORT>.
# Cas qu'un .http ne permet pas (deux enregistrements simultanés) : deux `curl … &` du même PUT avec le même expectedBudgets,
# attendu : un 200 et un 409 BUDGETS_CHANGED.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{port}}
@authUrl = http://127.0.0.1:54321/auth/v1

### Propriétaire jetable
# @name login
POST {{authUrl}}/signup
apikey: {{anon}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budgets-sim-{{$timestamp}}@example.com", "password": "Password123!" }

?? status == 200

### Membre en écriture jetable
# @name writer
POST {{authUrl}}/signup
apikey: {{anon}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budgets-sim-w-{{$timestamp}}@example.com", "password": "Password123!" }

?? status == 200

### Membre en lecture seule jetable
# @name reader
POST {{authUrl}}/signup
apikey: {{anon}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budgets-sim-r-{{$timestamp}}@example.com", "password": "Password123!" }

?? status == 200

### Autre utilisateur connecté (non membre)
# @name other
POST {{authUrl}}/signup
apikey: {{anon}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budgets-sim-o-{{$timestamp}}@example.com", "password": "Password123!" }

?? status == 200

### Compte : solde de départ 1000,00 €
# @name account
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "budgets-sim-{{$timestamp}}", "initialBalance": "100000" }

?? status == 201

### Partage en écriture
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{account.id}}/shares
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budgets-sim-w-{{$timestamp}}@example.com", "permission": "write" }

?? status >= 200
?? status < 300

### Partage en lecture seule
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts/{{account.id}}/shares
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budgets-sim-r-{{$timestamp}}@example.com", "permission": "read" }

?? status >= 200
?? status < 300

### Catégorie dépense Courses
# @name dep
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Courses", "color": "#112233", "type": "expense" }

?? status == 201

### Catégorie dépense Loyer
# @name dep2
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Loyer", "color": "#223344", "type": "expense" }

?? status == 201

### Catégorie revenu
# @name rev
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Salaire", "color": "#445566", "type": "income" }

?? status == 201

### Période : courses 400,00, loyer 800,00, salaire 2000,00
# @name per
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startDate": "2026-11-01", "endDate": "2026-11-30", "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "40000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep2.id}}", "amountAllocated": "80000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "200000" }
] }

?? status == 201

### Salaire réel +1500,00
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-02", "description": "salaire", "amount": "150000", "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}" }

?? status == 201

### Courses réelles -500,00
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-03", "description": "courses", "amount": "-50000", "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}" }

?? status == 201

### Loyer réel -1000,00 en attente (pending : compté par les stats)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-04", "description": "loyer", "amount": "-100000", "categoryId": "{{dep2.id}}", "pending": true }

?? status == 201

### Sans catégorie -20,00 en attente
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-05", "description": "import", "amount": "-2000", "pending": true }

?? status == 201

### Stats enregistrées
# départ 100000 ; revenus max(150000, 200000) = 200000 ; dépenses max(150000, 120000) = 150000 ; sans catégorie -2000
# prévu = 100000 + 200000 - 150000 - 2000 = 148000
# @name stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? body contains "plannedExpenses":"120000"
?? body contains "plannedIncome":"200000"
?? body contains "forecastBalance":"148000"

### Simulation = budgets enregistrés : égale aux stats, écart 0
# @name simSaved
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "40000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep2.id}}", "amountAllocated": "80000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "200000" }
] }

?? status == 200
?? body contains "forecastBalance":"{{stats.forecastBalance}}"
?? body contains "savedForecastBalance":"148000"
?? body contains "delta":"0"
?? body contains "incomeEffect":"0"
?? body contains "expensesEffect":"0"

### CA3 : loyer abaissé sous le réel : le total prévu change, pas le prévu (sans effet)
# dépenses prévues 40000 + 20000 = 60000 < réel 150000
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "40000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep2.id}}", "amountAllocated": "20000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "200000" }
] }

?? status == 200
?? body contains "plannedExpenses":"60000"
?? body contains "expensesEffect":"0"
?? body contains "delta":"0"
?? body contains "forecastBalance":"148000"

### Budget courses relevé à 1000,00 : dépenses prévues 180000 > réel 150000 : le prévu baisse de 300,00
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "100000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep2.id}}", "amountAllocated": "80000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "200000" }
] }

?? status == 200
?? body contains "plannedExpenses":"180000"
?? body contains "expensesEffect":"-30000"
?? body contains "delta":"-30000"
?? body contains "forecastBalance":"118000"

### Revenu prévu relevé à 2500,00 : +500,00
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "40000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep2.id}}", "amountAllocated": "80000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
] }

?? status == 200
?? body contains "incomeEffect":"50000"
?? body contains "expensesEffect":"0"
?? body contains "forecastBalance":"198000"

### Liste vide : aucun budget (le revenu retombe au réel)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [] }

?? status == 200
?? body contains "plannedExpenses":"0"
?? body contains "plannedIncome":"0"
?? body contains "forecastBalance":"98000"

### Budget négatif = budget positif (valeur absolue)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "-40000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep2.id}}", "amountAllocated": "80000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "200000" }
] }

?? status == 200
?? body contains "plannedExpenses":"120000"
?? body contains "forecastBalance":"148000"

### La simulation n'a rien écrit : trois budgets, courses toujours à 400,00
# @name before
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.length == 3
?? body contains "amountAllocated":"40000"

### Validation : catégorie inconnue du compte
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [ { "categoryId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111", "amountAllocated": "100" } ] }

?? status == 400

### Validation : catégorie en double
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "100" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "200" }
] }

?? status == 400

### Validation : montant illisible
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [ { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "abc" } ] }

?? status == 400

### Droits : membre en lecture seule, comme pour les stats
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{reader.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [ { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "40000" } ] }

?? status == 200

### Droits : autre utilisateur connecté
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{other.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [] }

?? status == 404

### Droits : anonyme
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [] }

?? status == 401

### Parité : simulation de X (courses 1500,00, loyer 800,00, salaire 2500,00)
# dépenses prévues 230000 > réel ; revenus max(150000, 250000) ; prévu = 100000 + 250000 - 230000 - 2000 = 118000
# @name simX
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "150000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep2.id}}", "amountAllocated": "80000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
] }

?? status == 200
?? body contains "forecastBalance":"118000"

### Parité : enregistrement de X
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "150000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep2.id}}", "amountAllocated": "80000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
] }

?? status == 200

### Parité : les stats après enregistrement = le prévu simulé, au centime
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? body contains "forecastBalance":"{{simX.forecastBalance}}"
?? body contains "plannedExpenses":"{{simX.plannedExpenses}}"
?? body contains "plannedIncome":"{{simX.plannedIncome}}"

### Budget à 0 : simulation (loyer à 0)
# dépenses prévues 150000 ; prévu = 100000 + 250000 - 150000 - 2000 = 198000
# @name simZero
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "150000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep2.id}}", "amountAllocated": "0" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
] }

?? status == 200
?? body contains "plannedExpenses":"150000"
?? body contains "forecastBalance":"198000"

### Budget à 0 : enregistrement, le budget du loyer n'est plus enregistré
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "150000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep2.id}}", "amountAllocated": "0" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
] }

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.length == 2

### Budget à 0 : deux budgets relus, stats = simulation
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.length == 2

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? body contains "forecastBalance":"{{simZero.forecastBalance}}"
?? body contains "plannedExpenses":"150000"

### Concurrence : le membre en écriture enregistre avec les budgets qu'il a vus (courses 1500, salaire 2500) -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{writer.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "160000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
],
"expectedBudgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "150000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
] }

?? status == 200

### Concurrence : le propriétaire enregistre avec les budgets périmés (courses 1500) -> 409 BUDGETS_CHANGED
# @name stale
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "10000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
],
"expectedBudgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "150000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
] }

?? status == 409
?? body contains "code":"BUDGETS_CHANGED"
?? body contains "error":"Conflict"

### Concurrence : rien n'a été écrit par le refus, les montants du membre sont là
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.length == 2
?? body contains "amountAllocated":"160000"

### Concurrence : après rechargement, le propriétaire enregistre -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "10000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
],
"expectedBudgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "160000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
] }

?? status == 200

### Concurrence : attendu vide alors que la base ne l'est pas -> 409
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [ { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "1" } ], "expectedBudgets": [] }

?? status == 409
?? body contains "code":"BUDGETS_CHANGED"

### Concurrence : membre en lecture seule avec un attendu juste -> 403 comme avant
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{reader.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [ { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "1" } ],
"expectedBudgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "10000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
] }

?? status == 403

### Concurrence : catégorie en double avec un attendu juste -> 409 sans code (autre cause)
# @name dup
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "100" },
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "200" }
],
"expectedBudgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "10000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{rev.id}}", "amountAllocated": "250000" }
] }

?? status == 409
?? js response.parsedBody.code isFalse

### Concurrence : le doublon refusé a laissé les budgets en place
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.length == 2
?? body contains "amountAllocated":"10000"

### Compatibilité : sans expectedBudgets (ancien front), pas de contrôle -> 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [ { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "20000" } ] }

?? status == 200

### Validation : expectedBudgets avec un montant illisible
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [], "expectedBudgets": [ { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "abc" } ] }

?? status == 400

### CA7 : période fermée, simulation et enregistrement restent possibles
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

?? status == 200

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [ { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "20000" } ] }

?? status == 200

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{per.id}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [ { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "30000" } ],
"expectedBudgets": [ { "categoryId": "{{dep.id}}", "amountAllocated": "20000" } ] }

?? status == 200
